\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Behold the Lamb of God, who bears
\par The sins of all the world away!
\par A servant's from He meekly wears,
\par He sojourns in a house of clay;
\par His glory is no longer seen,
\par But God with God is man with men.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. See where the God incarnate stands,
\par And calls His wandering creatures home!
\par He all day long spreads out His hands,
\par Come, weary souls, to Jesus come!
\par Ye all may hide you in My breast;
\par Believe, and I will give you rest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Sinners, believe the gospel word,
\par Jesus is come your souls to save!
\par Jesus is come, your common Lord;
\par Pardon ye all through Him may have,
\par May now be saved, whoever will;
\par This Man receiveth sinners still.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

